      <title>Bitcoin&#39;s purpose</title>
      <link>http://localhost:44883/bitcoins-purpose/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 08 Jan 2026 19:03:35 +0700</pubDate>
      <author>mail@juju.casa (Casa de JuJu)</author>
